#: main.cpp:100
msgid ""
"<qt>Here you can change your personal information, which will be used in mail "
"programs and word processors, for example. You can change your login password "
"by clicking <em>Change Password</em>.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Yazma, xatlar eşkärtü yazılımnarında qullanıla torğan şäxsi belemne bonda "
"üzgärtep bula. <em>Sersüz Üzägärtü</em> östenä çirtep kereş sersüzen almaştırıp "
"bula.</qt>"

#: main.cpp:115
msgid ""
"A program error occurred: the internal program 'kdepasswd' could not be found. "
"You will not be able to change your password."
msgstr ""
"Yazılımda xata kilep çıqtı: 'kdepasswd' atlı eçke yazılımnı tabıp bulmí. "
"Sürsüzen üzgärtep bulmí."

#: main.cpp:213
msgid "Please enter your password in order to save your settings:"
msgstr "Bu caylawnı saqlaw öçen sersüz kertäse bar:"

#: main.cpp:218
msgid "You must enter your password in order to change your information."
msgstr "Üz turında belem üzgärtü öçen üz sersüzen kertäse bar."

#: main.cpp:228
msgid "You must enter a correct password."
msgstr "Yaraqlı sersüz kertäse bar."

#: main.cpp:232
#, c-format
msgid ""
"An error occurred and your password has probably not been changed. The error "
"message was:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Xata kilep çıqtı, şuña kurä bu sersüz üzgärtelmi qaldı kebek. Ul xata "
"belderüe:\n"
"%1"

#: main.cpp:245
#, c-format
